@page "/docs/components/vekdatagrid/server-data"
@layout DocumentationLayout

<PageTitle>VekDataGrid Server Data | Vek Components</PageTitle>

<div class="docs-page-layout">
    <article class="docs-article">
        <h1>VekDataGrid: Server Data</h1>
        <p class="docs-intro">Load only the requested page and let the data source apply the grid's current sort and filter state.</p>

        <section id="live-example" class="docs-section-content" aria-labelledby="live-example-heading">
            <h2 id="live-example-heading">Live example</h2>
            <p>Sorting, filtering, and paging send a new cancellable request to the sample provider.</p>
            <div class="docs-example-frame">
                <VekDataGrid TItem="DemoProduct" ServerData="LoadServerPageAsync" PageSize="5">
                    <LoadingContent><p role="status">Loading products…</p></LoadingContent>
                    <ErrorContent Context="error"><p role="alert">Could not load products: @error.Message</p></ErrorContent>
                    <EmptyContent><p>No products match this request.</p></EmptyContent>
                    <ChildContent>
                        <PropertyColumn Property="product => product.Name" Title="Name" FilterOperator="VekDataGridFilterOperator.Contains" />
                        <PropertyColumn Property="product => product.Category" Title="Category" FilterOperator="VekDataGridFilterOperator.Contains" />
                        <PropertyColumn Property="product => product.Price" Title="Price" Format="C2" FilterOperator="VekDataGridFilterOperator.GreaterThanOrEqual" />
                    </ChildContent>
                </VekDataGrid>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="code" class="docs-section-content" aria-labelledby="code-heading">
            <h2 id="code-heading">Code</h2>
            <div class="code-sample">
                <div class="code-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Code sample files">
                    <button type="button" class="code-tab @(!_showCodeBehind ? "is-active" : null)" data-sample="razor" aria-pressed="@(!_showCodeBehind)" @onclick="ShowRazor">Sample.razor</button>
                    <button type="button" class="code-tab @(_showCodeBehind ? "is-active" : null)" data-sample="code-behind" aria-pressed="@_showCodeBehind" @onclick="ShowCodeBehind">Sample.razor.cs</button>
                </div>
                <pre><code>@SelectedCode</code></pre>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="server-contract" class="docs-section-content" aria-labelledby="server-contract-heading">
            <h2 id="server-contract-heading">Server request contract</h2>
            <p>The source receives the requested page, page size, sort definitions, filters, and a cancellation token. Return the page rows together with the total number of matching rows. A new request cancels the previous one; failures can be presented with <code>ErrorContent</code>, and <code>RefreshServerDataAsync</code> reloads the current request.</p>
        </section>
    </article>

    <nav class="docs-toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <h2>On this page</h2>
        <a href="/docs/components/vekdatagrid/server-data#live-example">Live example</a>
        <a href="/docs/components/vekdatagrid/server-data#code">Code</a>
        <a href="/docs/components/vekdatagrid/server-data#server-contract">Server request contract</a>
    </nav>
</div>
